{
  "nativeContract": "MY logs type21 as final health-change effect, payload[3]=bReact. Enum5 is reflected damage and13 is effective ordinary damage. Keep original IDs; qualified NPC-to-player result5 is returned player-to-NPC damage.",
  "limits": "Use the native returned amount once. No separate reflected-overkill flag is supplied, and no Buff-percent or HP-difference reconstruction is claimed. Mixed ordinary/effective damage or healing, wrong discriminator/direction and legacy imports are rejected. Buff3026 active subtotal includes the owner's other reflection too and is not the set's isolated damage.",
  "primarySources": [
    {
      "name": "MY_CombatLogs.lua",
      "url": "https://github.com/cattenblue/MY/blob/master/MY_TeamTools/src/MY_CombatLogs.lua",
      "gitBlobSha1": "b643cf383e60d1f2b318571c43ec5a383dd63458",
      "originalEncoding": "gb18030",
      "sourceSha256": "d9695f8eebd09bf4fffe40990c7d090391695c637da181c5babf805e47abb05c",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "startLine": 163,
          "endLine": 169,
          "content": "\tPARTY_ADD_MEMBER                      = 16, -- 团队添加成员\n\tPARTY_SET_MEMBER_ONLINE_FLAG          = 17, -- 团队成员在线状态改变\n\tMSG_SYS                               = 18, -- 系统消息\n\tSYS_MSG_UI_OME_SKILL_CAST_LOG         = 19, -- 技能施放日志\n\tSYS_MSG_UI_OME_SKILL_CAST_RESPOND_LOG = 20, -- 技能施放结果日志\n\tSYS_MSG_UI_OME_SKILL_EFFECT_LOG       = 21, -- 技能最终产生的效果（生命值的变化）\n\tSYS_MSG_UI_OME_SKILL_BLOCK_LOG        = 22, -- 格挡日志"
        },
        {
          "startLine": 561,
          "endLine": 569,
          "content": "\telseif szEvent == 'SYS_MSG_UI_OME_SKILL_EFFECT_LOG' then\n\t\t-- if not X.IsInArenaMap() then\n\t\t-- 技能最终产生的效果（生命值的变化）；\n\t\t-- (arg0)dwCaster：施放者 (arg1)dwTarget：目标 (arg2)bReact：是否为反击 (arg3)nType：Effect类型 (arg4)dwID:Effect的ID\n\t\t-- (arg5)dwLevel：Effect的等级 (arg6)bCriticalStrike：是否会心 (arg7)nCount：tResultCount数据表中元素个数 (arg8)tResultCount：数值集合\n\t\tif D.WillRecID(arg0) or D.WillRecID(arg1) then\n\t\t\tD.OnTargetUpdate(arg0)\n\t\t\tD.OnTargetUpdate(arg1)\n\t\t\tD.InsertLog(LOG_TYPE.SYS_MSG_UI_OME_SKILL_EFFECT_LOG, { arg0, arg1, arg2, arg3, arg4, arg5, arg6, arg7, arg8 })"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "MY_Recount_DS.lua",
      "url": "https://github.com/cattenblue/MY/blob/master/MY_Recount/src/MY_Recount_DS.lua",
      "gitBlobSha1": "098b677a850ade33ad49e6ef6707ee7a911a7d41",
      "originalEncoding": "gb18030",
      "sourceSha256": "0cf363c25fae7404113fe8c96b83a7305e6815d1caedff8871f8418bf7fc1d59",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "startLine": 162,
          "endLine": 176,
          "content": "SKILL_RESULT_TYPE.PHYSICS_DAMAGE       = 0  -- 外功伤害\nSKILL_RESULT_TYPE.SOLAR_MAGIC_DAMAGE   = 1  -- 阳性内功伤害\nSKILL_RESULT_TYPE.NEUTRAL_MAGIC_DAMAGE = 2  -- 混元性内功伤害\nSKILL_RESULT_TYPE.LUNAR_MAGIC_DAMAGE   = 3  -- 阴性内功伤害\nSKILL_RESULT_TYPE.POISON_DAMAGE        = 4  -- 毒性伤害\nSKILL_RESULT_TYPE.REFLECTIED_DAMAGE    = 5  -- 反弹伤害\nSKILL_RESULT_TYPE.THERAPY              = 6  -- 治疗\nSKILL_RESULT_TYPE.STEAL_LIFE           = 7  -- 生命偷取(<D0>从<D1>获得了<D2>点气血。)\nSKILL_RESULT_TYPE.ABSORB_THERAPY       = 8  -- 化解治疗\nSKILL_RESULT_TYPE.ABSORB_DAMAGE        = 9  -- 化解伤害\nSKILL_RESULT_TYPE.SHIELD_DAMAGE        = 10 -- 无效伤害\nSKILL_RESULT_TYPE.PARRY_DAMAGE         = 11 -- 拆招\nSKILL_RESULT_TYPE.INSIGHT_DAMAGE       = 12 -- 识破\nSKILL_RESULT_TYPE.EFFECTIVE_DAMAGE     = 13 -- 有效伤害\nSKILL_RESULT_TYPE.EFFECTIVE_THERAPY    = 14 -- 有效治疗"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
